{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005330/extras/c2e1dd54a022e3b67f697f0703c66fd0.poster.avif?t=1758936128\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005330/extras/c2e1dd54a022e3b67f697f0703c66fd0.webm?t=1758936128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005330/extras/c2e1dd54a022e3b67f697f0703c66fd0.mp4?t=1758936128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>high-octane third-person shooter</strong>, weaving precision gunplay with devastating spell-craft.  <br><br>Play as Vivian, the\u00a0 <strong>Warden Magus</strong>, chosen to stand at the edge of collapse. Armed with the <strong>Spell Trigger</strong>, a weapon that fuses modern firearms with raw spell power, confront an otherworldly force behind a mysterious wave of slumber and mortality threatening humanity.<br> <br> <br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell-Infused Combat</strong> \u2013 Shoot, unleash spells, and chain abilities in fluid third-person action shooter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Support</strong> - Join forces with friends to take on missions together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong> \u2013 Level up, unlock new spells, and enhance your arsenal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Story Campaign</strong> \u2013 Face a hidden entropy faction threatening humanity, with missions that expand the lore of the Magus Order. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i